    <string name="coach_programs_info_how_body">About %1$d sessions a week. Tick each part as you go and say how it felt. After %2$d sessions, once two in a row feel easy, you can move up a level - only if you want to.</string>
    <string name="coach_programs_info_not_right_title">If it doesn\'t feel right</string>
    <string name="coach_programs_info_not_right_body">Use the easier version, go less far, or skip that exercise. If sessions keep hurting, step back a level and check with a physio.</string>
    <string name="coach_programs_info_not_right_mind">Use the easier version or a shorter time. If it keeps not helping, step back a level - and talk to someone if you\'re struggling.</string>
